==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:Sobering Homecoming]] in order to do [[Quest:Bike Retrieval]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Dorn Geargrinder]] located in [[Rumble Ridge]], [[Sunstone Valley]].
==Goals==
Find the missing Freewheeler bikes in Sandscale territory.
*Find Freewheeler Bikes - /6
*Return to Dorn Geargrinder
*Talk to Golmie Greasebeard
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Dorn Geargrinder]] located in [[Rumble Ridge]], [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"What good's a bunch of Dwarven Bikers without bikes? While I was gone, those darned Skullz pitched our bikes over the ridge into <font color='#D9781A'>Sandscale</font> territory.<br />If you can find our <font color='#D9781A'>bikes</font> we’ll be able to serve up some humble pie to the Skullz." -Dorn Geargrinder
#Find Freewheeler Bikes - /6
#*Freewheeler Bike pieces are scattered all around Sandscale Territory
#Speak with [[Dorn Geargrinder]] located in [[Rumble Ridge]], [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"It's good to see my old ride again. It’s in bad shape, but I’m sure Golmie Greasebeard can fix it up." -Dorn Geargrinder
#*"Golmie can fix anything." -Player response
#Speak with [[Golmie Greasebeard]] located in [[Rumble Ridge]], [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Woo wee, these hogs've seen better days. Well, a busy dwarf's a happy dwarf." -Golmie Greasebeard
#*"Thanks!" -Player response
